{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_title", "source_sha256": "05c63cd8352b95228fba25d7aabf71f20b1aa7eb692318fb6314e3e2f1083807", "ja": "ステージに立つということ", "zh": "站在舞台上的意义", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_synopsis", "source_sha256": "35b042b183da7c7f84e9bf06234c8104e4be6983daf643e67e9eeb71edbab953", "ja": "杏奈の新曲公演のレッスンが始まる。だが、\nハイテンションすぎる杏奈に違和感を覚える\nメンバー達。どんなにレッスンをしても不安\nが消えない事を打ち明ける杏奈だったが、\nプロデューサーとの会話で笑顔を取り戻す。", "zh": "杏奈新曲公演的练习开始了。然而，\n成员们却对情绪过于亢奋的杏奈\n感到有些不对劲。杏奈吐露了无论怎样练习\n都无法消除心中不安的烦恼，\n但与制作人的交谈让她重拾了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29531b81ade41388229d83d3c4c5f3527c8a1e4c38d1873165427d46f16182f0", "ja": "（杏奈、新曲を気に入ったみたいだったな。\nさて、今日のレッスンは確か……）", "zh": "（杏奈好像很喜欢这首新歌啊。\n那么，今天的练习应该是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "6faec677ee979a46062e05aea9f6a9ad4fd6981600665e464d35a215382f3aa0", "ja": "それじゃあ、もう1回全員で通しだね！\nビビッと、いってみよ～！", "zh": "那就全员再完整练习1遍吧！\n精神十足地上吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "c7744934e7b5966ce3d23c79eaabe79b8a23f6bd9b6e84c0460acc13a399ab4a", "ja": "はいっ！　ありさ、どこまでも\n杏奈ちゃんについていきます！", "zh": "是！亚利沙会一直跟着杏奈的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "454a30e663e75ba6b5c707cb3ad2ac69c0a5ee2e439eda80f4dcf9e175a33535", "ja": "ロコも、コンディションはバッチリですよ！\n新曲の振り付けもパーフェクトです♪", "zh": "ROCO的状态也非常好哦！\n新歌的舞蹈动作也完全没问题♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "4816d4ad231c792552d6fef949b42f76633947ad19f5d119b6652072c1ba2f47", "ja": "みんな、ちょっと待って。桃子は、\nBメロが気になったんだけど……歌織さんはどう？", "zh": "大家，稍微等一下。桃子觉得\nB段有点让人在意……歌织小姐觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "5f390d485d002b67b8266df4ee8bcb7dfdb07170c78c80c40cde8970c8067e5c", "ja": "そうね……じゃあ次は、パートごとに区切って\nひとつずつ確かめていくのはどうかしら？", "zh": "嗯……那么接下来，按段落分开，一段一段确认怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "ec7aa334e53c7ebc546549e91622d0859f052199444f94b35920fd667dc908ad", "ja": "そのあと、もう一度通しでやってみましょう。\n杏奈ちゃん、これでいい？", "zh": "之后，再完整地做一遍吧。\n杏奈，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "ad6eae597ce615a6515b178ee7c9b05112d0d8f7fd34d69e1b7b865098e1a731", "ja": "うん、大賛成！\n桃子ちゃんも、それで大丈夫かなっ！？", "zh": "嗯，非常赞成！\n桃子这样也没问题吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "823cd2ee6faf3cdd56c32bde2426e3b193e5dad7b3b5cff17798e1dc91cc3176", "ja": "あ……うん。\n歌織さん、ありがとう。", "zh": "啊……嗯。\n歌织，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1009_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8fb3ded8dee475d61c4476e3e87b08d31f8fa85c723ee96107493a038807e165", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n歌のレッスン、順調そうだな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n歌唱训练看起来进行得很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "886775b7e76df491e38c4d3284ab2c1215da92bc694c5c6bb97202b9925f4580", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nうんっ！　杏奈もみんなも、絶好調です♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嗯！杏奈和大家状态超好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "5045ce50e7fd51142022643d9cb99dc6abf1933df96c0ac1849582ec6cc9884a", "ja": "次のステージ、楽しみにしててね！\n杏奈、ビビッとパーフェクトにきめちゃうから！", "zh": "期待一下接下来的舞台吧！\n杏奈会用满满的电波感，完美拿下的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3855c524f908f4ab8377f0c2c56b85e4c872cff9002307b35f1d6807bb0a4190", "ja": "ああ、期待してるぞ！", "zh": "啊，我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4b1b48e1de069b1b9128b01a633f91a743de178e1218145377093473270cdf62", "ja": "（杏奈、すごく頑張ってるみたいだ。\nけど、なんだろう。何か、引っかかるような……？）", "zh": "（杏奈好像一直在努力。\n可是，这是怎么回事呢？总觉得有哪里不太对劲……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1016_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "1937e3272709ed2758f9b5018beb004e6948d3eb5e0c1c83d86315791efb6aa3", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nあの、今ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n那个，现在方便打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c8dc34d5017d530befae5c7973dec2cf2ebb5cfc74e1b7110aa9de6e13bd376a", "ja": "亜利沙、お疲れさま。そうか、もうこんな時間か……\n今日のレッスンはどうだった？", "zh": "亜利沙，辛苦了。原来已经这么晚了啊……今天的课程怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "a4c609a25c68905e7fee06112736ce4b38feedae44233f3b95a6cd0f57ff2e76", "ja": "はい。あの、ありさたちは終わりましたケド、\n杏奈ちゃんがまだ続けるって言って……。", "zh": "是的。那个，阿利莎她们已经结束了，不过，杏奈还说要继续……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "04f4a4b6ccb230c726243efe5f25fda9cf21c2535e15604bac14d96736bde0b1", "ja": "今、歌織さんとふたりで残って、\n歌のレッスンをしてるところです。", "zh": "现在正和歌织小姐两个人留下来，练习唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1021_p", "source_sha256": "acbfa5f3595029bd642d10e61f74e5decded0402d746544e20f47f8d50c42b19", "ja": "えっ？　杏奈、まだ練習してるのか？\nちょっと根を詰めすぎだな……。", "zh": "诶？杏奈，你还在练习吗？\n有点太拼了吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "0f2a85baaa39369efb298b1dad22454cda2878851136d7772fa53aef7bff2aca", "ja": "ありさもそう思って、声をかけたんですケド……\n杏奈ちゃん、まだまだエネルギー充分って……。", "zh": "我也是这么想的，所以就出声提醒她了，可是……杏奈说自己还精力充沛得很……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93", "ja": "そうか……。", "zh": "是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "c257dabc9ede27551ee10f52bea0ea32d63cef08f4332994c2caa478de9f656b", "ja": "{$P$}さん。最近の杏奈ちゃん、\nちょっと、様子がおかしくありませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。最近杏奈的状态，是不是有点不太对劲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "df0ef03f0aa5c16247fbd318e1c528315d3df90f888779666dbd172b16f24073", "ja": "最初はやる気なんだって思ってたんですケド、\nありさ、なんだか心配になってきちゃって……。", "zh": "一开始我以为她只是干劲十足，但不知为何，亚利沙越来越担心她了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1026_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "f598a46fc6edf9494b02cfc1ea8899134fe52e426a3f8df5177d45fec14c36ef", "ja": "{$P$}、エマージェンシーです！\n急いでミーティングしたいことがあります！", "zh": "{$P$}，有紧急情况！\n有件事想赶紧开会商量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "515dce02854afcac0121dbb5e24f65e1ed4d312a24cf1879daae5f1becc5cd9c", "ja": "ねえ、お兄ちゃん……\nあっ、亜利沙さんとお話し中？", "zh": "那个，哥哥……\n啊，你正在和亚利沙姐姐聊天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ca7ebbcdf7d0494f9dc15f213dca5e7ea703da864a4f4e1a307730ec3480bd96", "ja": "ロコ、桃子……\nふたりも、杏奈のことか？", "zh": "ROCO、桃子……你们两个也是为了杏奈的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "bbfca9b4b0caf276735072827e441f24d5b64d409139aa330a4a139daf5cb101", "ja": "はい！　アンナのことでミーティングがしたくて……\nもしかして、アリサもですか？", "zh": "是的！我想就杏奈的事情开个会……\n难道亚利沙也要参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "8c698ededea42cbb217a78a684296f9dd195608112386552517f6b036eb5a071", "ja": "じゃあ、ロコちゃんと桃子ちゃんも……。", "zh": "那，ROCO和桃子也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "32bcc7871f99d621c906cbd46797767ff6b646bcba89101d0a9916be71d9ecb5", "ja": "うん。……杏奈さん、ちょっと変だよね。もしかして、\n無理してるんじゃないかなって思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。……杏奈有点奇怪吧。桃子在想，\n她会不会是在勉强自己啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1033_025roc", "source_sha256": "b4828dfe97ec7b35a2a0381de36ce0b423780673e556b20f9be9ac6e79e944f4", "ja": "それに、アンナがずっとハイテンションなのも変です！\n買ったばかりのゲーム、ちっとも遊んでないですし。", "zh": "而且，杏奈一直处于高涨状态也很奇怪！\n刚买的游戏，她也完全没玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1034_p", "source_sha256": "830e109584417d6e6633290c55d84289a2d79f0ca73c54a4b24a3ef884f1e3d2", "ja": "ゲームもか……。わかった、杏奈と話してみるよ。\nみんな、心配してくれてありがとう。", "zh": "游戏也是吗……我知道了，我去和杏奈谈谈。\n谢谢大家为我担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "3a7b979117d52b17460527d49c8c7b88591516582b74671e93199f5cc5cfbbd7", "ja": "べ、別に、桃子は心配したわけじゃないけど……。\nでも、杏奈さんが変だと思ったのは本当だから。", "zh": "才、才不是因为担心桃子才……  \n不过，桃子觉得杏奈小姐不太对劲，这是真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1036_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1037_052kao", "source_sha256": "953802a6fcf2fe77080526d406c4f8625a1e5343579444d40f25657b0c1e25d6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n……まぁ、みんないたのね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n……哎呀，大家都在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1039_p", "source_sha256": "b251dcf86bd4ec1be9713519ca14be904ce7aacfdf5346f822c34913ccb093d2", "ja": "歌織さん、杏奈。ちょうど良かった。\n歌のレッスンはもう終わったんですか？", "zh": "歌织小姐，杏奈。来得正好。\n歌唱练习已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "fafa43006ab4fb1c6d62c49bbd995b0dca995231e2d8998219c80bb1c523e598", "ja": "はい。ただ……正確には、\n私から中断させてもらったんです。", "zh": "是的。不过……准确地说，是我主动叫停了练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "1618e92501dad41a4db35998c3c94a65bb97fb26e936d24a650ac54d0fca8340", "ja": "これ以上レッスンを続けると、杏奈ちゃんの\n体に悪い影響が出るんじゃないかと思って……。", "zh": "我觉得要是再继续训练下去，可能会对杏奈的身体造成不好的影响……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1043_p", "source_sha256": "3e3366d17b18d5888fdccb2fffe72b75c2f1836cb81c26b0bae5b891b733eed1", "ja": "そうでしたか……\nありがとうございます、歌織さん。", "zh": "原来是这样……谢谢你，歌织小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "cf5ff78e2992a7b3db65b4931818aa3a79641c76b13ddabba18eeb7c4104468a", "ja": "大丈夫……です……。", "zh": "没事……的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1045_p", "source_sha256": "0987c267325dd513b8ee49b8527833a36a22ac0e33d1853cd64b98236f3d59a3", "ja": "杏奈？", "zh": "杏奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1046_024ann", "source_sha256": "8fb2b0586fb485bd93f13c072e847edf807c3cd95e2b8dc119e17da626d8f9e7", "ja": "杏奈……まだ、大丈夫……\nもっと……レッスン、できます……。", "zh": "杏奈……还、没事……\n还可以……继续练习……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "909b26eab6af5d15c3f4bbcd047aa0bf9b9e39474704cb610a9079691fe0a36b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1048_p", "source_sha256": "6c85ac926ba7d651877f3378cfc9f5daab4aefc16c258ff855ce8b6797208a05", "ja": "そうだな。でも……\nその前に、杏奈に確認しておきたい事があるんだ。", "zh": "是啊。不过……\n在那之前，我有件事想先向杏奈确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1049_024ann", "source_sha256": "65bfd79e6c616948c7d73b35fdc083504a6436c4a307083aa3ca15c61372282e", "ja": "……？　確認しておきたい、こと……\nなんですか……？", "zh": "……？　想确认的、事情……\n是什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1050_p", "source_sha256": "06e431641e691c4422dabd437e6238aa2cab6a4d05450fdafd929974fed3b271", "ja": "うん。杏奈は次の公演、どんな\nステージにしたいと思ってるのかなって。", "zh": "嗯。我想知道杏奈对于下次的公演，\n想呈现出怎样的舞台呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1051_024ann", "source_sha256": "2fe78f5d19a59f541a539d9dbaaa9183f978d50da7247033c49d2fe3fc2c4be8", "ja": "どんなステージ……えっと……。", "zh": "什么样的舞台……呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1052_024ann", "source_sha256": "3dfd13558cc89101ea503dd2cadb2f0965f36c2ae51619591ffd35577c266540", "ja": "杏奈は……応援してくれる、ファンの人たちに……\nもっと、よろこんでもらいたい……です……。", "zh": "杏奈想让一直为自己加油的粉丝们……更加开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1053_024ann", "source_sha256": "4fc44a422fb2e874ad432d625cf377d39a3ceba438a54f042b2b71897fc2df36", "ja": "……杏奈、初めてのセンター公演……\n緊張したけど……楽しかった……。", "zh": "……杏奈第一次当C位的演出……\n虽然很紧张……但很开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1054_024ann", "source_sha256": "f453c1dbf040ed5202608f88e36e0d23fdeba5d13b8f1722352054f21fb681cd", "ja": "ファンのみんなが、応援してくれたから……\n今度は……杏奈がみんなに、お返しする番……。", "zh": "因为粉丝们……都为杏奈加油了……\n所以下次……轮到杏奈回报大家了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1055_p", "source_sha256": "3683a7eac5c9ffa0d3d8de8a071e021e04aa913211905b4d501b7d65fa744044", "ja": "なるほど。\nそれが、今の杏奈の原動力なんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n那就是现在杏奈的动力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1056_052kao", "source_sha256": "6c50daa0e2d0132101b70b366accf43318b351ef9b12e4560246534acfe75796", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんは、お客さんを楽しませたくて、\nそれでレッスンを頑張っていたのね。", "zh": "原来如此。\n安娜是想让客人开心，所以才努力练习的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1057_024ann", "source_sha256": "80fc400ae0f728d19229ab8065d93064b761baa36b1112f8fc46c70990236868", "ja": "でも……杏奈、全然できてる気がしない……\nレッスンしても、ずっと……不安……。", "zh": "可是……杏奈觉得自己完全没做好……就算练习了，还是一直……很不安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1058_024ann", "source_sha256": "e56fb6b2a12d3bb709aacb5ada7e56d8fbea4bfc92533a08d089d762a7ba72e5", "ja": "だから、やっぱり……まだ、\nレッスンが足りないって……思い、ます……。", "zh": "所以，果然……我还是觉得……练习，还不够……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1059_p", "source_sha256": "c539d07fd54ba93b8a4992aa5e5b1de746fc1e8a843a459c1027977ac3b354a3", "ja": "杏奈……。", "zh": "杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1060_025roc", "source_sha256": "9ac78e8c9cff03256c3fba1ff04475fe3dc3172e4c73a0dde98b251a0089d39d", "ja": "それでアンナは、ゲームもプレイしてないんですか？\nずっと待ってたんですよね？", "zh": "所以，杏奈连游戏都没玩吗？\n一直在等着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1061_024ann", "source_sha256": "8bbe5bd8201ab9af5617027434c8734ea88c9524705d501383e63608f32f3f0b", "ja": "ん……でも……。\nゲームより……練習、しないと……。", "zh": "嗯……可是……\n比起游戏……必须先、练习才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1062_028ari", "source_sha256": "42c129f167b4f77c8bc7f4bcc40b8dc9cc863dd8a9948eb69729c2e5b7a6c4d7", "ja": "あの杏奈ちゃんが、ゲームをガマンしてまで……！\nものすごい力の入りようですけど、でも……。", "zh": "那个杏奈竟然能忍住不玩游戏……！\n虽然干劲十足得不可思议，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1063_049mom", "source_sha256": "20facdee648d32086436ad002b8a8d47c040550d6ba9ec581aa4f1d5ca65d659", "ja": "うん……。\n桃子も、ちょっと違うと思う……かな。", "zh": "嗯……\n桃子也觉得……好像有点不太对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1064_024ann", "source_sha256": "d0d6c325140764cdf7a4b52dee35c28d1a9c2a7080aa8bfc0cd7926d5a41b1c3", "ja": "え……？　違う……？", "zh": "诶……？不一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1065_p", "source_sha256": "b430688944f39750785b13c696dfb7f20a29f36d097763a58c8a9850de466faf", "ja": "杏奈。杏奈はあのゲームが出るの、\nすごく楽しみにしてたよな？", "zh": "杏奈。你一直都特别期待那款游戏发售的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1066_024ann", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1067_p", "source_sha256": "5350670e79d55838f7499970aa154516cc01740c13870510f4c9573232e84c10", "ja": "でも、ゲームを作った人達は……もしかしたら、\n今の杏奈と、同じ気持ちだったかもしれないな。", "zh": "不过，制作那个游戏的人们……说不定，也曾和现在的杏奈，有着同样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1068_024ann", "source_sha256": "fbb310cf70a09b6692e4f95cbcd3e765f07aaae79c5ef95852a7b42e19696968", "ja": "え……？　でも、あのゲーム……\nすごく、面白い……です……。", "zh": "诶……？可是，那个游戏……\n真的，非常有意思……呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1069_024ann", "source_sha256": "567bb94cf5df959bb2f5d296aabe9fa39bb2a0a09ddc7e8a89f609aa261bdb97", "ja": "……杏奈、みたいに……\n不安なんて……そんなこと……。", "zh": "……像杏奈这样的……\n不安什么的……怎么会……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1070_p", "source_sha256": "1e91b1a8b09bb2d34e90b0593c4b9eb4536f395d55978daabb7e184dc059868d", "ja": "そうだな。ゲームを作った人じゃないし、\n本当の所はわからないけど……。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟我不是制作游戏的人，真正的情况也不清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1071_p", "source_sha256": "63dab05c2fc3997a7c9a65f4d5b3a8b40719aabe9939c6d285b27c2244753ba2", "ja": "でも、本当に杏奈が「面白い」って言ってくれるか\nどうかまでは、わからなかったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不过，他可能也不知道杏奈到底会不会说“有趣”吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1072_024ann", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1073_p", "source_sha256": "24ad0ab8579d5d8983bb2e576a993cb6355d7af9016de30f8887af7a1b77bee3", "ja": "一生懸命やった事が、お客さんを笑顔にできるかどうか\n……その不安は、なくならない物なのかもしれないな。", "zh": "拼尽全力所做的一切，能不能让客人露出笑容……\n这份不安，或许是不会消失的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_062_1074_024ann", "source_sha256": "6790120cc950270bd7130da992408bac5709186bde986b6e0368f25f817ab3c3", "ja": "そう……なのかな……。\nいっぱい、がんばっても……消えない、のかな……？", "zh": "是……这样吗……\n就算拼尽全力……也还是无法消除吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
